{"type": "tool_use", "timestamp": 1793897008901, "sessionID": "ses_e53682497ffesMRSoEDcY3Ny2z", "part": {"type": "tool", "tool": "knowledge_search_docs", "callID": "call_990d105dfde8455b82d8b0fbe5d4b8f2", "state": {"status": "completed", "input": {"query": "PaymentsService PaymentsAPI OrderService RenewalsWorker take payments direct callers", "k": 3}, "output": "[renewals-worker#Integrations]\nRenewalsWorker: Integrations\nIt depends on BillingService and calls the PaymentsAPI directly, without going through OrderService, because a renewal has no cart.\n\n[order-service#Integrations]\nOrderService: Integrations\nIt calls the PaymentsAPI to authorize and capture. It depends on UserService to resolve the ordering customer.\n\n[payments-service#Operations]\nPaymentsService: Operations\nCalls to the provider are retried on network errors only, never on a decline, because retrying a decline can trigger the provider's fraud checks.", "metadata": {"truncated": false}, "title": "", "time": {"start": 1793897006174, "end": 1793897008878}}, "metadata": {"openai": {"itemId": "fc_059a207595c04042016aecb22db98087d1b4ac8210a943cffd"}}, "id": "prt_1ac9802df001Jehjd0r0rnXrG4", "sessionID": "ses_e53682497ffesMRSoEDcY3Ny2z", "messageID": "msg_1ac97f95a001hfkbMzhh32TaMf"}}
