{"type": "text", "timestamp": 1793897012308, "sessionID": "ses_e53682497ffesMRSoEDcY3Ny2z", "part": {"id": "prt_1ac98171500152W6wuR8y0l2cj", "messageID": "msg_1ac980efd001DRXZ0sEzsPBUhK", "sessionID": "ses_e53682497ffesMRSoEDcY3Ny2z", "type": "text", "text": "If **PaymentsService** is down, these two direct callers of its **PaymentsAPI** can no longer take payments:\n\n- **OrderService** \u2014 calls PaymentsAPI to authorize and capture payments.\n- **RenewalsWorker** \u2014 calls PaymentsAPI directly to process renewal payments, without going through OrderService.\n\nNo database or configuration key is involved in this direct dependency answer.", "time": {"start": 1793897010965, "end": 1793897012305}, "metadata": {"openai": {"itemId": "msg_0d90cce0e854e11d016aecb232e5e887d18fb22d1c1a9e52d6", "phase": "final_answer"}}}}
